{"4897410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Birdwatcher's Journal", "steam_appid": 4897410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/18a9c87f55d5d4b61dd6e87b41d5e73f.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip showing a pan of the island.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/18a9c87f55d5d4b61dd6e87b41d5e73f.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/18a9c87f55d5d4b61dd6e87b41d5e73f.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NuMei is delighted to offer you the position of research intern. Since the previous researcher disappeared unexpectedly, you’ll be needed to head to the island and fill in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/139199694575ea7c8747b208a0a668f2.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip of the player pulling up a camera over a palm tree, where several birds are roosting. A flash indicates they&#039;ve taken a photograph, and a print of that photo is pulled up and flipped. The bottom right corner has the label &amp;quot;Photograph Birds&amp;quot;.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/139199694575ea7c8747b208a0a668f2.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/139199694575ea7c8747b208a0a668f2.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary duty will be to explore the island, cataloguing the birds you find. Use your trusty NuMei Virtu-Cam to photograph each species of bird that you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/79db5835eb51d8cc31706e507add7039.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip of the player placing photos into a journal. Each photo depicts a type of bird, and after placement, the camera is locked to confirm they are the correct species. In the bottom left corner is a label that states &amp;quot;Identify Birds&amp;quot;.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/79db5835eb51d8cc31706e507add7039.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/79db5835eb51d8cc31706e507add7039.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, place those photos in your journal when you’ve determined which bird is which. As you fill out your journal, we will validate and confirm your research. Your stipend will be automatically deposited based on performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/80202a31cc3709c6374ce06b41f44274.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip of the player waling up to a ruin or structure. There is a small podium with glyphs on them, and a gateway-like structure to its left. The bottom right corner has a label with &amp;quot;Discover the Mysteries&amp;quot;.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/80202a31cc3709c6374ce06b41f44274.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/80202a31cc3709c6374ce06b41f44274.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest assured, despite your predecessor’s disappearance, we remain confident that the island is innocuous and danger-free. Any anomalies, mysterious ruins or other strange happenings should be ignored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/18a9c87f55d5d4b61dd6e87b41d5e73f.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip showing a pan of the island.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/18a9c87f55d5d4b61dd6e87b41d5e73f.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/18a9c87f55d5d4b61dd6e87b41d5e73f.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NuMei is delighted to offer you the position of research intern. Since the previous researcher disappeared unexpectedly, you’ll be needed to head to the island and fill in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/139199694575ea7c8747b208a0a668f2.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip of the player pulling up a camera over a palm tree, where several birds are roosting. A flash indicates they&#039;ve taken a photograph, and a print of that photo is pulled up and flipped. The bottom right corner has the label &amp;quot;Photograph Birds&amp;quot;.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/139199694575ea7c8747b208a0a668f2.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/139199694575ea7c8747b208a0a668f2.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your primary duty will be to explore the island, cataloguing the birds you find. Use your trusty NuMei Virtu-Cam to photograph each species of bird that you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/79db5835eb51d8cc31706e507add7039.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip of the player placing photos into a journal. Each photo depicts a type of bird, and after placement, the camera is locked to confirm they are the correct species. In the bottom left corner is a label that states &amp;quot;Identify Birds&amp;quot;.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/79db5835eb51d8cc31706e507add7039.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/79db5835eb51d8cc31706e507add7039.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, place those photos in your journal when you’ve determined which bird is which. As you fill out your journal, we will validate and confirm your research. Your stipend will be automatically deposited based on performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/80202a31cc3709c6374ce06b41f44274.poster.avif?t=1785885502\" aria-label=\"A clip of the player waling up to a ruin or structure. There is a small podium with glyphs on them, and a gateway-like structure to its left. The bottom right corner has a label with &amp;quot;Discover the Mysteries&amp;quot;.\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/80202a31cc3709c6374ce06b41f44274.webm?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/extras/80202a31cc3709c6374ce06b41f44274.mp4?t=1785885502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rest assured, despite your predecessor’s disappearance, we remain confident that the island is innocuous and danger-free. Any anomalies, mysterious ruins or other strange happenings should be ignored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Photograph and identify birds on a mysterious island. Each bird you discover brings you one step closer to uncovering what happened to the researcher before you, and the secrets of the island.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4897410/8adf173b18973ad11ca45f9cc51b9e56eb565a1a/header.jpg?t=1785885502", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item